  lines:
  - Welcome to Vatheria! I'm Orin. Let's get you settled.
  - "The Farmlands are full of ripe crops. Let\u2019s gather a few."
  - "Open <link=\"help:quests\"><u><color=#EFB889>Quests</color></u></link> to see what needs doing and claim your rewards. You\u2019ll meet the townsfolk along the way."
